The registry's 0.2.0 release has an invalid Kafka request-header encoding.
This pinned source includes the upstream header fix; moon.work resolves the
dependency here so clean builds do not depend on patched registry caches.

Local fixes verified against Apache Kafka 4.0.0:
- CreateTopics v7 TopicConfigErrorCode is tagged, not an inline field.
- Ignore records before the requested fetch offset before applying the poll cap.
